url: 'https://www.thebiomics.com/node/637'
abstract: >-
  GMXvg is a lightweight Python package for automated parsing and plotting of
  GROMACS `.xvg` output files. It provides an easy-to-use interface for
  generating high-quality, publication-ready graphs. By simplifying the
  workflow from raw simulation data to visualization, GMXvg enables
  researchers to analyze molecular dynamics results more efficiently and reproducibly.
